<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσχετος</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀάσχετος</span></b> ,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχεῖν</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be checked,
				ungovernable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθος ἄσχετον οὐκ ἐπιεικτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.549
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀάσχετον ἵκετο πένθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.708
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μένος ἄσχετοι υἷες Ἀχαιῶν</span>
			<i>resistless</i> in might, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.104
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητρός τοι μένος ἐστὶν ἀάσχετον οὐδ᾽
					ἐπιεικτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.892
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάκον ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					92
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕβρις</span> Epic. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				7.6
			</span></i>: in later Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. δίψος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Dips.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ὁρμή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					2.12
				</span></i>
			; of a person, <i>ungovernable, unmanageable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.2071
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
				121.593
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					415d
				</span></i>
			: neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσχετον, -τα,</span> as
				Adv., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1738
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1087
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not held together,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				533.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>unrelated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			
			<i>in</i>
			
			<i>Prm. (Rh.Mus.</i><i><span class="en">
				47.605
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				5.163b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Cra.</u>
				p.57
			</span></i> P., al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. σχέσις</span> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i>Aphr.<i><span class="en">
				<u>in SE</u>
				152.24
			</span></i>; <i>unqualified,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span> Dex.<i><span class="en">
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				51.21
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>Inst.</u>
					122
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Cra.</u>
				p.70
			</span></i> P.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
